<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="popover" data-kv-variant="help" data-klic-component="popover" class="kn-popover" data-state="closed"><label data-part="field"><span>프로젝트 코드</span><input type="text" value="KLC-001"  data-part="input"></label><div data-part="popover-wrap"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="popover-open" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="kv-export-popover-popover-help-popover"  data-part="btn">코드 작성 도움말</button><div data-klic-surface="overlay" id="kv-export-popover-popover-help-popover" role="region" aria-label="코드 작성 도움말" data-kv-floating popover="manual" hidden data-part="floating-panel" data-state="closed"><header data-part="heading"><strong>쉽게 구분하는 코드</strong></header><p data-part="muted">영문 대문자 3자와 숫자 3자를 하이픈으로 연결하세요.</p><span data-part="badge">예: KLC-001</span><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="popover-close"  data-part="btn">닫기</button></div></div><output aria-live="polite" data-part="output"></output></div>
